Selecta Furnace replayer module (plugins/replayers/furnace)
============================================================

This module statically links the headless Furnace engine (tildearrow/furnace v0.6.8.3), so the combined module is
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later version. Verified from the
upstream LICENSE (third_party/furnace/LICENSE): GPL-2.0-or-later. The GPLv3 ASIO SDK named upstream is not used. It is
built only with -DSELECTA_GPL_PLUGINS=ON as a separate loadable module; the Selecta core never links it and stays MIT.
The adapter and shim sources in this directory are MIT like the core and usable under the GPL as part of this module.

Vendored code notes (third_party/furnace, see REVISION):

  - Engine and platform sources: GPL-2.0-or-later.
  - QSound and Supervision cores: no licence stated upstream. Removed (like bbmp); songs on those chips are silent there.
  - YM2608 ADPCM ROM and rss ROM: replaced by silence arrays; YM2608 drum samples are silent. Open item.
  - extern/adpcm (superctr): Unlicense, public domain. extern/fmt: MIT. Other chip cores keep their own licence files.
  - Furnace demo songs are all rights reserved and are not vendored; the test fixture is original.
